('79871644-c728-5f57-b660-435fe80b430d','fe793fc7-3b39-5774-9508-9e078b2c702d',1,'adjective','A2','S2','W2','( comparative safer , superlative safest )','[{"phrase":"to be on the safe side","register":"spoken","definition_en":"to do something in order to be certain to avoid an unpleasant situation","translation":"انجام کاری برای اطمینان از اجتناب از موقعیت ناخوشایند","example":"I’d take an umbrella, just to be on the safe side.","example_translation":"من یک چتر برمی‌داشتم، فقط برای اینکه در امنیت باشم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000740038.mp3"},{"phrase":"be in safe hands","register":null,"definition_en":"to be with someone who will look after you very well","translation":"با کسی باشید که خیلی خوب از شما مراقبت کند","example":"Everyone wants to feel that their children are in safe hands.","example_translation":"همه می خواهند احساس کنند که فرزندانشان در دستان امنی هستند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000740043.mp3"},{"phrase":"a safe pair of hands","register":null,"definition_en":"someone you can trust and depend on because they are sensible – used especially in news reports","translation":"کسی که می توانید به او اعتماد کنید و به او تکیه کنید زیرا معقول هستند - به ویژه در گزارش های خبری استفاده می شود","example":"Colleagues regard him as a safe pair of hands.","example_translation":"همکاران او را به عنوان یک جفت دست امن می دانند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001537060.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
