('2b9a8fc0-47a9-5dde-9e02-29474b43e835','c460bc0c-d1c6-58f2-abfa-db3b1e527634',1,'determiner','A1','S1','W1','( plural these / ðiːz / )','[{"phrase":"this is it","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to say that something you expected to happen is actually going to happen","translation":"می گفت چیزی که انتظار داشتی اتفاق بیفتد واقعاً اتفاق خواهد افتاد","example":"This is it, boys – the moment we’ve been waiting for.","example_translation":"این است، پسران - لحظه ای که منتظرش بودیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787503.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
