('b97d3d5b-94ea-5897-87ad-b8e6de87a81d','8273b35f-71f3-5d89-890a-49c906d31656',1,'noun','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"all the time","register":null,"definition_en":"continuously or very often","translation":"به طور مداوم یا اغلب اوقات","example":"I keep practising and I’m improving all the time.","example_translation":"من به تمرین ادامه می دهم و همیشه در حال پیشرفت هستم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817855.mp3"},{"phrase":"most of the time","register":null,"definition_en":"very often or almost always","translation":"اغلب یا تقریباً همیشه","example":"I can speak German but we speak English most of the time.","example_translation":"من می توانم آلمانی صحبت کنم اما بیشتر اوقات انگلیسی صحبت می کنیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000572879.mp3"},{"phrase":"at times","register":null,"definition_en":"sometimes","translation":"گاهی اوقات","example":"Life is hard at times.","example_translation":"زندگی گاهی سخت است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000572894.mp3"},{"phrase":"from time to time","register":null,"definition_en":"sometimes , but not regularly or very often","translation":"گاهی اوقات، اما نه به طور منظم یا اغلب","example":"These food safety scares happen from time to time.","example_translation":"این ترس از ایمنی مواد غذایی هر از گاهی اتفاق می افتد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817865.mp3"},{"phrase":"at all times","register":null,"definition_en":"always – used especially in official rules and statements","translation":"همیشه - به ویژه در قوانین و بیانیه های رسمی استفاده می شود","example":"Children must be supervised at all times while in the park.","example_translation":"کودکان باید همیشه در هنگام حضور در پارک تحت نظارت باشند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000572917.mp3"},{"phrase":"at the time","register":null,"definition_en":"at a particular moment or period in the past when something happened, especially when the situation is very different now","translation":"در یک لحظه یا دوره خاص در گذشته که اتفاقی افتاده است، به خصوص زمانی که وضعیت اکنون بسیار متفاوت است","example":"I was about ten or eleven at the time.","example_translation":"من در آن زمان حدود ده یا یازده ساله بودم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573048.mp3"},{"phrase":"at one time","register":null,"definition_en":"at a time in the past but not now","translation":"در زمانی در گذشته اما نه اکنون","example":"At one time she wanted to be a nurse, but the thought of working at night put her off.","example_translation":"زمانی او می خواست پرستار شود، اما فکر شب کار کردن او را از کار انداخت.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817877.mp3"},{"phrase":"at this time","register":null,"definition_en":"at this particular moment","translation":"در این لحظه خاص","example":"The president said his actions were ‘the right ones at this time’.","example_translation":"رئیس‌جمهور گفت که اقدامات او «در حال حاضر درست بوده است».","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573060.mp3"},{"phrase":"at no time","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say strongly that something never happened or should never happen","translation":"به شدت می گفت چیزی هرگز اتفاق نیفتاده یا نباید هرگز اتفاق بیفتد","example":"At no time did anyone involved speak to the press.","example_translation":"هیچ وقت هیچ کس درگیر با مطبوعات صحبت نکرد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817880.mp3"},{"phrase":"for the time being","register":null,"definition_en":"for a short period of time from now, but not permanently","translation":"برای مدت کوتاهی از هم اکنون، اما نه برای همیشه","example":"Now, for the time being, she is living with her father in Tijuana.","example_translation":"در حال حاضر او با پدرش در تیجوانا زندگی می کند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817886.mp3"},{"phrase":"with time to spare","register":null,"definition_en":"sooner than expected or necessary","translation":"زودتر از حد انتظار یا ضروری","example":"We should arrive in New York with time to spare.","example_translation":"ما باید با وقت خالی به نیویورک برسیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817906.mp3"},{"phrase":"over time","register":null,"definition_en":"if something happens over time, it happens gradually during a long period","translation":"اگر چیزی در طول زمان اتفاق بیفتد، به تدریج در طول یک دوره طولانی اتفاق می افتد","example":"The research project will be assessed over time.","example_translation":"پروژه تحقیقاتی در طول زمان مورد ارزیابی قرار خواهد گرفت.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817907.mp3"},{"phrase":"take your time","register":null,"definition_en":"to do something slowly or carefully without hurrying","translation":"کاری را آهسته یا با دقت و بدون عجله انجام دادن","example":"Marie took her time cutting my hair and did it really well.","example_translation":"ماری برای کوتاه کردن موهای من وقت گذاشت و این کار را خیلی خوب انجام داد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573201.mp3"},{"phrase":"on time","register":null,"definition_en":"at the correct time or the time that was arranged","translation":"در زمان صحیح یا زمانی که تنظیم شده است","example":"Jack was worried about whether he’d be able to get there on time.","example_translation":"جک نگران بود که آیا بتواند به موقع به آنجا برسد یا خیر.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000572977.mp3"},{"phrase":"behind the times","register":null,"definition_en":"old-fashioned","translation":"از مد افتاده","example":"Our equipment is a bit behind the times.","example_translation":"تجهیزات ما کمی عقب تر از زمان است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817972.mp3"},{"phrase":"before your time","register":null,"definition_en":"before you were born or before you started working or living somewhere","translation":"قبل از اینکه متولد شوید یا قبل از شروع کار یا زندگی در جایی","example":"They say he was a great actor but that was before my time.","example_translation":"آنها می گویند او یک بازیگر بزرگ بود اما قبل از زمان من بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573388.mp3"},{"phrase":"do time","register":null,"definition_en":"to spend a period of time in prison","translation":"مدتی را در زندان بگذراند","example":"Paul was doing time for burglary.","example_translation":"پل برای دزدی وقت می گذاشت.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001818020.mp3"},{"phrase":"make good time","register":null,"definition_en":"if you make good time on a journey , you travel quickly, especially more quickly than you expected","translation":"اگر زمان خوبی را در سفر بگذرانید، سریع سفر می کنید، به خصوص سریعتر از آنچه انتظار داشتید","example":"We made good time and were at the hotel by lunchtime.","example_translation":"وقت خوبی گذراندیم و تا ناهار در هتل بودیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573214.mp3"},{"phrase":"time is money","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that wasting time or delaying something costs money","translation":"می گفت که اتلاف وقت یا به تاخیر انداختن کاری هزینه دارد","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"time is on your side","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that someone is young enough to be able to wait before doing something or until something happens","translation":"می گفت کسی آنقدر جوان است که بتواند قبل از انجام کاری یا تا زمانی که اتفاقی بیفتد صبر کند","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"time flies","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that a period of time seems to pass very quickly","translation":"قبلاً می گفت که یک دوره زمانی به نظر می رسد خیلی سریع می گذرد","example":"‘Is it midnight already?’ ‘Well, you know what they say – time flies when you’re having fun !’","example_translation":"«آیا الان نیمه شب است؟» «خب، می‌دانی که آنها چه می‌گویند - زمانی که شما سرگرم می‌شوید زمان می‌گذرد!»","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001780609.mp3"},{"phrase":"all in good time","register":null,"definition_en":"used when someone wants to do something soon but you want to wait a little","translation":"زمانی استفاده می شود که کسی می خواهد کاری را به زودی انجام دهد اما شما می خواهید کمی صبر کنید","example":"‘When can we open our presents, Mum?’ ‘All in good time, Billy.’","example_translation":"«کی می‌توانیم هدیه‌هایمان را باز کنیم، مامان؟» «به موقع، بیلی.»","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040082.mp3"},{"phrase":"time of life","register":null,"definition_en":"used to refer to someone’s age","translation":"برای اشاره به سن کسی استفاده می شود","example":"At my time of life, you can’t take too many shocks like that.","example_translation":"در زمان زندگی من، شما نمی توانید چنین شوک های زیادی را تحمل کنید.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001818046.mp3"},{"phrase":"your time","register":null,"definition_en":"used in certain expressions to refer to the period when you are alive","translation":"در عبارات خاصی برای اشاره به دوره ای که شما زنده هستید استفاده می شود","example":"I’ve met some rude women in my time but she’s the worst.","example_translation":"من در زمان خود با چند زن بی ادب آشنا شده ام اما او بدترین است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001818050.mp3"},{"phrase":"time of the month","register":null,"definition_en":"the time when a woman has her period","translation":"زمانی که یک زن پریود می شود","example":"It’s that time of the month.","example_translation":"آن زمان از ماه است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001818066.mp3"},{"phrase":"time out of mind","register":"literary","definition_en":"a very long time, or a very long time ago","translation":"خیلی وقته یا خیلی وقت پیش","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
