('1f480b94-8e03-54e6-89fa-2b7a6f8873ba','8d9bacec-ce22-528d-a621-8bf84da58985',2,'adverb','A2','S3','W3',null,'[{"phrase":"wide open","register":null,"definition_en":"if a competition , election etc is wide open, it is possible for anyone to succeed","translation":"اگر رقابت، انتخابات و غیره کاملاً باز باشد، ممکن است هر کسی موفق شود","example":"Most experts agree that the election is wide open at this point.","example_translation":"اکثر کارشناسان معتقدند که انتخابات در این مقطع کاملاً باز است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657527.mp3"},{"phrase":"wide of the mark","register":null,"definition_en":"not correct about something, by a large amount","translation":"درست نیست در مورد چیزی، تا حد زیادی","example":"The opinion polls were hopelessly wide of the mark.","example_translation":"نظرسنجی‌ها به طرز ناامیدکننده‌ای بسیار گسترده بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001986814.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
