('ec130caa-5d24-586e-b228-ec2561924720','21803d72-914d-5816-bdee-f331c8d5603e',1,'get rid of','خلاص شدن از شر','spoken & written','to get rid of something that you no longer need or want',null,null,'برای خلاص شدن از شر چیزی که دیگر به آن نیاز ندارید یا نمی خواهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['shed jobs/workers/staff etc The bank continued to shed workers.','shed weight (= lose weight from your body ) Doing exercise is the best way to shed surplus weight.','shed pounds/kilos (= to lose this amount of weight ) I needed to shed a few pounds.','shed an image (= change people''s opinion about someone or something ) Has the industry finally shed its negative image?','shed your inhibitions (= stop worrying about what other people will think of your behaviour ) As the party went on, people began to shed their inhibitions.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company is planning to shed about a quarter of its workforce.","translation":"این شرکت قصد دارد حدود یک چهارم نیروی کار خود را اخراج کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000711818.mp3"},{"sentence":"The magazine is desperately trying to shed its old-fashioned image.","translation":"این مجله به شدت در تلاش است تا تصویر قدیمی خود را از بین ببرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637248.mp3"},{"sentence":"a diet to help you shed pounds","translation":"یک رژیم غذایی برای کمک به کاهش وزن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637243.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
