('3700f421-30a1-5053-b4c6-20b56fc60f25','21803d72-914d-5816-bdee-f331c8d5603e',3,'plants/animals','گیاهان/حیوانات','spoken & written','if a plant sheds its leaves or if an animal sheds skin or hair , they fall off as part of a natural process',null,null,'اگر گیاهی برگ‌هایش را بریزد یا حیوانی پوست یا موی خود را بریزد، به عنوان بخشی از یک فرآیند طبیعی می‌ریزند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['shed jobs/workers/staff etc The bank continued to shed workers.','shed weight (= lose weight from your body ) Doing exercise is the best way to shed surplus weight.','shed pounds/kilos (= to lose this amount of weight ) I needed to shed a few pounds.','shed an image (= change people''s opinion about someone or something ) Has the industry finally shed its negative image?','shed your inhibitions (= stop worrying about what other people will think of your behaviour ) As the party went on, people began to shed their inhibitions.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The trees were starting to shed their leaves .","translation":"درختان شروع به ریختن برگ های خود کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000711812.mp3"},{"sentence":"As it grows, a snake will regularly shed its skin .","translation":"وقتی مار رشد می کند، پوست خود را به طور مرتب می ریزد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000711813.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
