media/english/exaProns/p008-000683194.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t want to hear any of your sick jokes , thank you.","translation":"من نمی خواهم هیچ یک از جوک های بیمار شما را بشنوم، متشکرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000683199.mp3"},{"sentence":"That’s really sick !","translation":"این واقعاً بیمار است!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001673217.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
