('16924790-e3c8-5a8e-af96-e7121de2b9a1','a284302f-e451-5ba9-840f-6e8e5e83cacc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a place where something important or interesting happened',null,null,'محل، جا (رخداد)؛ سایت (وب)؛ محل (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an archaeological site Archaeological sites are often discovered by accident.','a historic site There are numerous historic sites to visit.','an ancient site The organization maintains and restores ancient sites, castles, monuments etc.','a sacred site (= a place that is important in a religion ) Ayers Rock is the most sacred site of the Aborigines.','a burial site A Bronze Age burial site has been discovered.','the crash site (= where a plane etc crashed ) Wreckage was seen 200 metres away from the crash site.','a bomb site (= where a bomb has exploded ) the bomb sites of war-torn London','a building/construction site He has worked on various building sites.','a greenfield site British English (= a piece of land that has never been built on ) We want to shift the balance of housing development from greenfield to brownfield sites.','a brownfield site British English (= a piece of land that has been built on before ) The majority of the houses will be built on brownfield sites.','a camp/camping site First they had to look for a camp site.','a caravan site British English: A well-run caravan site near the river brings holidaymakers into the village.','a landfill site (= where rubbish is buried ) Recycling reduces the volume of waste which goes into landfill sites.','an industrial site (= where factories are ) The area is to be redeveloped as an industrial site.','a missile site There were photos of a missile site under construction.','a nesting site Normally the male swan won’t let other swans near his nesting site.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an archaeological site","translation":"یک سایت باستان شناسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691304.mp3"},{"sentence":"The house is built on the site of a medieval prison.","translation":"این خانه در محل یک زندان قرون وسطایی ساخته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691307.mp3"},{"sentence":"the site of the air crash","translation":"محل سقوط هواپیما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001599816.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5a74a29f-347a-5681-9004-7569ed96a948','a284302f-e451-5ba9-840f-6e8e5e83cacc',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an area of ground where something is being built or will be built',null,null,'منطقه ای از زمین که در آن چیزی در حال ساخت یا ساخته شدن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an archaeological site Archaeological sites are often discovered by accident.','a historic site There are numerous historic sites to visit.','an ancient site The organization maintains and restores ancient sites, castles, monuments etc.','a sacred site (= a place that is important in a religion ) Ayers Rock is the most sacred site of the Aborigines.','a burial site A Bronze Age burial site has been discovered.','the crash site (= where a plane etc crashed ) Wreckage was seen 200 metres away from the crash site.','a bomb site (= where a bomb has exploded ) the bomb sites of war-torn London','a building/construction site He has worked on various building sites.','a greenfield site British English (= a piece of land that has never been built on ) We want to shift the balance of housing development from greenfield to brownfield sites.','a brownfield site British English (= a piece of land that has been built on before ) The majority of the houses will be built on brownfield sites.','a camp/camping site First they had to look for a camp site.','a caravan site British English: A well-run caravan site near the river brings holidaymakers into the village.','a landfill site (= where rubbish is buried ) Recycling reduces the volume of waste which goes into landfill sites.','an industrial site (= where factories are ) The area is to be redeveloped as an industrial site.','a missile site There were photos of a missile site under construction.','a nesting site Normally the male swan won’t let other swans near his nesting site.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the site of a proposed missile base","translation":"محل یک پایگاه موشکی پیشنهادی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691314.mp3"},{"sentence":"a site for a new airport","translation":"سایتی برای فرودگاه جدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001599817.mp3"},{"sentence":"He managed to get himself a job on a building site.","translation":"او موفق شد برای خود شغلی در یک سایت ساختمانی پیدا کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001775441.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('c2b6288b-37cf-54e8-953e-d2f398be159d','a284302f-e451-5ba9-840f-6e8e5e83cacc',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a place that is used for a particular purpose',null,null,'مکانی که برای هدف خاصی استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an archaeological site Archaeological sites are often discovered by accident.','a historic site There are numerous historic sites to visit.','an ancient site The organization maintains and restores ancient sites, castles, monuments etc.','a sacred site (= a place that is important in a religion ) Ayers Rock is the most sacred site of the Aborigines.','a burial site A Bronze Age burial site has been discovered.','the crash site (= where a plane etc crashed ) Wreckage was seen 200 metres away from the crash site.','a bomb site (= where a bomb has exploded ) the bomb sites of war-torn London','a building/construction site He has worked on various building sites.','a greenfield site British English (= a piece of land that has never been built on ) We want to shift the balance of housing development from greenfield to brownfield sites.','a brownfield site British English (= a piece of land that has been built on before ) The majority of the houses will be built on brownfield sites.','a camp/camping site First they had to look for a camp site.','a caravan site British English: A well-run caravan site near the river brings holidaymakers into the village.','a landfill site (= where rubbish is buried ) Recycling reduces the volume of waste which goes into landfill sites.','an industrial site (= where factories are ) The area is to be redeveloped as an industrial site.','a missile site There were photos of a missile site under construction.','a nesting site Normally the male swan won’t let other swans near his nesting site.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a camping site","translation":"یک سایت کمپینگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001599818.mp3"},{"sentence":"a nesting site for birds","translation":"یک مکان لانه سازی برای پرندگان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001599823.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('03a6f094-1f62-570c-ac20-c962dfe3f40a','a284302f-e451-5ba9-840f-6e8e5e83cacc',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a website',null,null,'یک وب سایت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('5b2a2dfd-fe05-5869-91be-7c6c669f621e','a284302f-e451-5ba9-840f-6e8e5e83cacc',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'on site','محل، جا (رخداد)؛ سایت (وب)؛ محل (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f23b699a-b1c5-515e-85ef-0e1ac9b0cb26','cdd334a2-60f0-541e-a707-652ee797b0a1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to place or build something in a particular place',null,null,'قرار دادن یا ساختن چیزی در مکانی خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some of this new housing has been sited in inner city areas.","translation":"برخی از این مسکن جدید در مناطق داخلی شهر قرار گرفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691332.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('da04e83f-d134-5921-8240-a897573efb1f','f292bdff-0281-5b3a-ae0d-60ad506b2ba2',1,'how big','چقدر بزرگ','spoken & written','how big or small something is','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'اندازه، حجم؛ اندازه (پوشاک)؛ اندازه (شکم)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the same size The water vole is about the same size as a rat.','a different size Six towns of different sizes were selected for the research.','a good/fair/nice size (= fairly big ) The garden is a good size.','the small size of something One problem was the very small size of the department.','the large size of something They are very peaceful fish, despite their large size.','the sheer size of something (= used to emphasize that something is large ) The sheer size of some dinosaurs is amazing.','something’s original size The lake has already shrunk to half its original size.','full size (= the largest size that something can have ) Is this violin full size?','be twice the size of something The creature was about twice the size of a small dog.','be half the size of something Kosovo is about half the size of Wales.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s a small boy, about John’s size.","translation":"او یک پسر کوچک است، تقریباً اندازه جان.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691833.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Jensens’ house is about the same size as ours.","translation":"خانه جنسن ها تقریباً به اندازه خانه ما است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020239.mp3"},{"sentence":"The firm underestimated the size of the market for their new product.","translation":"این شرکت اندازه بازار محصول جدید خود را دست کم گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691828.mp3"},{"sentence":"I saw a spider the size of (= the same size as ) my hand in the backyard.","translation":"عنکبوت به اندازه (= هم اندازه) دستم را در حیاط پشتی دیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605652.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s quite a big dog, but he’s still not full size yet.","translation":"او یک سگ بسیار بزرگ است، اما هنوز اندازه کاملی ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605657.mp3"},{"sentence":"The apartment is roughly 360 square feet in size.","translation":"مساحت آپارتمان تقریباً 360 فوت مربع است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605661.mp3"},{"sentence":"In a class this size, there are bound to be a few troublemakers.","translation":"در کلاسی به این اندازه، مطمئناً چند مشکل ساز وجود خواهد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691838.mp3"},{"sentence":"We can’t give loans of that size to just anyone.","translation":"ما نمی‌توانیم به کسی وام در این اندازه بدهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605665.mp3"},{"sentence":"These phones come in all shapes and sizes.","translation":"این گوشی ها در اشکال و اندازه های مختلف تولید می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691841.mp3"},{"sentence":"The breakfast room is a good size.","translation":"اتاق صبحانه اندازه خوبی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691849.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('9f0c40ba-812c-5fe1-8beb-a624e82346e8','f292bdff-0281-5b3a-ae0d-60ad506b2ba2',2,'very big','بسیار بزرگ','spoken & written','used to say that something is very big','[ uncountable ]',null,'می گفت چیزی خیلی بزرگ است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the same size The water vole is about the same size as a rat.','a different size Six towns of different sizes were selected for the research.','a good/fair/nice size (= fairly big ) The garden is a good size.','the small size of something One problem was the very small size of the department.','the large size of something They are very peaceful fish, despite their large size.','the sheer size of something (= used to emphasize that something is large ) The sheer size of some dinosaurs is amazing.','something’s original size The lake has already shrunk to half its original size.','full size (= the largest size that something can have ) Is this violin full size?','be twice the size of something The creature was about twice the size of a small dog.','be half the size of something Kosovo is about half the size of Wales.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t believe the size of her car!","translation":"من نمی توانم اندازه ماشین او را باور کنم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000691856.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sheer size of the classes makes learning difficult for students.","translation":"حجم زیاد کلاس ها یادگیری را برای دانش آموزان دشوار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605666.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
