('3a09a9e5-a3fa-5307-9ef3-ac57e8ecaaa6','f99cdb85-2854-50f5-9ab3-22d131dc734c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to notice someone or something, especially when they are difficult to see or recognize',null,null,'دیدن، متوجه شدن (چیز پنهان)؛ تشخیص دادن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I spotted a police car behind us.","translation":"یک ماشین پلیس را پشت سرمان دیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662414.mp3"},{"sentence":"It can be hard for even a trained doctor to spot the symptoms of lung cancer.","translation":"تشخیص علائم سرطان ریه حتی برای یک پزشک آموزش دیده نیز می تواند سخت باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586215.mp3"},{"sentence":"Meg spotted someone coming out of the building.","translation":"مگ کسی را دید که از ساختمان بیرون می آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662418.mp3"},{"sentence":"Drug addicts are fairly easy to spot.","translation":"تشخیص معتادان به مواد مخدر نسبتاً آسان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662421.mp3"},{"sentence":"One of the station staff spotted that I was in difficulty, and came to help.","translation":"یکی از کارکنان ایستگاه متوجه شد که من در مشکل هستم و برای کمک آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586222.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('d24d4f00-d7b6-5279-ab48-24f3bd3a076c','f99cdb85-2854-50f5-9ab3-22d131dc734c',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be spotted with something','دیدن، متوجه شدن (چیز پنهان)؛ تشخیص دادن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b2bdb040-921d-502f-8b61-f8fcc66e91d4','f99cdb85-2854-50f5-9ab3-22d131dc734c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to give the other player in a game an advantage',null,null,'برای دادن امتیاز به بازیکن دیگر در یک بازی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He spotted me six points and he still won.","translation":"او 6 امتیاز به من داد و همچنان برنده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662445.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('52c48a06-773d-598e-bd84-bf70db754a31','90bcfdd8-0539-5445-b0a2-a926fc822eae',1,null,null,'spoken & written','for buying or paying immediately, not at some future time',null,null,'برای خرید یا پرداخت فوری، نه در آینده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They won’t take credit; they want spot cash .","translation":"آنها اعتبار نمی گیرند؛ آنها پول نقد می خواهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586227.mp3"},{"sentence":"He quoted us a spot price for the goods.","translation":"او به ما قیمت لحظه ای کالا را نقل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586231.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('db5c1b85-d272-57a7-bb38-32f843827894','70c9d1d2-e0ea-5ac8-8c6c-09463ab93a6e',1,'in the sky','در آسمان','spoken & written','a large ball of burning gas in space that can be seen at night as a point of light in the sky',null,'falling star , morning star , shooting star','ستاره، ستاره (آسمان)؛ ستاره (فرد)؛ ستاره (رتبه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a star shines I looked up and saw hundreds of stars shining in the sky.','a star twinkles (= shines with an unsteady light ) Stars began to twinkle in the darkening night sky.','stars appear/come out (= appear in the sky ) We arrived home just as the stars were coming out.','the stars are out (= they are shining ) There was a full moon, and the stars were out.','look up at the stars I had spent a lot of time looking up at the stars as a kid.','sleep under the stars (= in a place with no roof ) In the desert, they slept out under the stars.','bright the brightest star in the night sky','faint The star is faint but visible.','a distant star (= very far away ) He stared up towards the distant stars.','a cluster of stars (= a small group of stars close together in the sky ) He fixed his telescope on a tiny little cluster of stars in the constellation of Taurus.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I lay on my back and looked up at the stars.","translation":"به پشت دراز کشیدم و به ستاره ها نگاه کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000638690.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sky was filled with stars.","translation":"آسمان پر از ستاره شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001651779.mp3"},{"sentence":"The stars were shining .","translation":"ستاره ها می درخشیدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040241.mp3"},{"sentence":"The stars were all out (= they were shining ) .","translation":"ستارگان همه بیرون بودند ( = می درخشیدند ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001651784.mp3"},{"sentence":"The stars were twinkling overhead (= shining and quickly changing from bright to faint ) .","translation":"ستارگان بالای سرشان چشمک می زدند (= می درخشیدند و به سرعت از روشن به کم نور تغییر می کردند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040242.mp3"},{"sentence":"sitting around a campfire under the stars","translation":"نشستن دور آتش زیر ستاره ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020257.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('f647cb5e-3864-5077-86ad-2dcc569b5790','70c9d1d2-e0ea-5ac8-8c6c-09463ab93a6e',2,'famous performer/player','مجری/بازیکن معروف','spoken & written','a famous and successful actor , musician , or sports player',null,null,'یک بازیگر، نوازنده یا ورزشکار معروف و موفق','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"By the age of 20, she was already a big star (= a very famous and successful performer ) .","translation":"در سن 20 سالگی، او قبلاً یک ستاره بزرگ (= یک مجری بسیار مشهور و موفق) بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040243.mp3"},{"sentence":"He is a rising star (= someone who is becoming famous and successful ) in the music world.","translation":"او یک ستاره در حال ظهور (= کسی که در حال تبدیل شدن به معروف و موفق) در دنیای موسیقی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040244.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s a good actress but she lacks star quality (= a special quality that could make someone a star ) .","translation":"او بازیگر خوبی است اما فاقد کیفیت ستاره ای است (= کیفیت خاصی که می تواند از کسی ستاره شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001651819.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b2af9329-132a-5ea7-829e-f221d1dfec19','70c9d1d2-e0ea-5ac8-8c6c-09463ab93a6e',3,'main person in a film/play etc','شخص اصلی در یک فیلم / نمایشنامه و غیره','spoken & written','the person who has the main part, or one of them, in a film, play, show etc',null,null,'شخصی که نقش اصلی یا یکی از آنها را در یک فیلم، نمایشنامه، نمایش و غیره دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Ray Grimes, the star of the television series ‘Brother John’","translation":"ری گرایمز، ستاره سریال تلویزیونی «برادر جان»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001651831.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
