ww.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001635828.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many people opted to remain in their homes.","translation":"بسیاری از مردم ترجیح دادند در خانه های خود بمانند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"She remained as his deputy for ten years.","translation":"او ده سال معاون او باقی ماند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,11),
