('b9d91057-8c59-579c-8dd0-296b5eb1189e','eee12305-3dc9-59f2-91b5-4f0891990e25',12,'consider','در نظر بگیرید','spoken & written','to react to someone or something or consider them in a particular way','[ intransitive, transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'واکنش نشان دادن به کسی یا چیزی یا در نظر گرفتن آنها به شیوه ای خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was joking, but he took me seriously.","translation":"شوخی کردم اما او مرا جدی گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001803491.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ben took the news very badly.","translation":"بن این خبر را بسیار بد دریافت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001803492.mp3"},{"sentence":"She does not take kindly to criticism (= reacts badly to criticism ) .","translation":"او به انتقاد مهربانی نمی کند (= به انتقاد واکنش بدی نشان می دهد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001834565.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll take that remark as a compliment.","translation":"من این تذکر را به عنوان یک تعریف و تمجید تلقی می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001803495.mp3"},{"sentence":"The presence of dust clouds has been taken as evidence of recent star formation.","translation":"وجود ابرهای غباری به عنوان شواهدی از شکل گیری ستاره های اخیر در نظر گرفته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001803498.mp3"},{"sentence":"I took her to be his daughter.","translation":"من او را به عنوان دختر او گرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001803501.mp3"},{"sentence":"Of course I won’t tell anyone! What do you take me for ? (= what sort of person do you think I am? )","translation":"البته به کسی نمیگم! منو واسه چی میبری؟ (= به نظر شما من چه جور آدمی هستم؟)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001572.mp3"},{"sentence":"I take it (= I assume ) you’ve heard