('9618c7d6-4778-503c-995b-86ad4021ac33','b114160b-803f-5a5e-8272-69963d3260af',1,'communicate something','ارتباط برقرار کردن چیزی','spoken & written','if someone tells you something, they communicate information , a story , their feelings etc to you','[ transitive ]','see Thesaurus box on 000000','گفتن، بیان کردن؛ خبر دادن (از)؛ فرمان دادن (به)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tell a story/tale He then told the story of how he was injured while riding his motorcycle.','tell a joke They sat around telling terrible jokes.','tell somebody a secret I offered to tell her my secret if she didn’t tell anyone else.','tell a lie They told lies about us.','tell the truth ‘I’m telling you the truth, ’ she persisted.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I wish someone had told me the meeting was canceled.","translation":"کاش یکی به من می گفت که جلسه لغو شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586707.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Chief of Police told reporters that two people were killed in the blast.","translation":"رئیس پلیس به خبرنگاران گفت که در این انفجار دو نفر کشته شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619592.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jack had to go, but he didn’t tell me why.","translation":"جک باید برود، اما به من نگفت چرا.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619595.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think you’d better tell me exactly what’s been going on around here.","translation":"فکر می کنم بهتر است به من بگویید دقیقاً در اینجا چه خبر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619596.mp3"},{"sentence":"No one had told them about the drug’s side effects.","translation":"هیچ کس در مورد عوارض جانبی دارو به آنها نگفته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586715.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll tell you all about it when I get back.","translation":"وقتی برگشتم همه چیز را به شما خواهم گفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619604.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tell me your phone number again.","translation":"دوباره شماره تلفنت را بگو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586718.mp3"},{"sentence":"She told us some funny stories about her sister.","translation":"او چند داستان خنده دار در مورد خواهرش برای ما تعریف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586722.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sheppard was telling the truth .","translation":"شپرد راست می گفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619612.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tell me straight, Adam. Just answer yes or no.","translation":"رک به من بگو آدام. فقط جواب بله یا خیر را بدهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586729.mp3"},{"sentence":"His book describes how the human brain has developed.","translation":"کتاب او چگونگی رشد مغز انسان را شرح می دهد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,11),
('b0fc1189-5ec7-5a40-b5fb-7b769897e6fd','b114160b-803f-5a5e-8272-69963d3260af',2,'show something','چیزی را نشان دهد','spoken & written','to give information in ways other than talking','[ transitive ]',null,'دادن اطلاعات به روش هایی غیر از صحبت کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tell a story/tale He then told the story of how he was injured while riding his motorcycle.','tell a joke They sat around telling terrible jokes.','tell somebody a secret I offered to tell her my secret if she didn’t tell anyone else.','tell a lie They told lies about us.','tell the truth ‘I’m telling you the truth, ’ she persisted.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The light tells you when the machine is ready.","translation":"چراغ به شما می گوید که دستگاه چه زمانی آماده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619623.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bear’s sense of smell tells it where prey is hiding.","translation":"حس بویایی خرس به او می گوید که طعمه در کجا پنهان شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619624.mp3"},{"sentence":"What do these fossils tell us about climate change?","translation":"این فسیل ها در مورد تغییرات آب و هوایی به ما چه می گویند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619627.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('90e4c5e1-e3d8-5f81-9b9d-346b47c7ba95','b114160b-803f-5a5e-8272-69963d3260af',3,'what somebody should do','کاری که کسی باید انجام دهد','spoken & written','to say that someone must do something','[ transitive ]',null,'گفتن اینکه کسی باید کاری انجام دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tell a story/tale He then told the story of how he was injured while riding his motorcycle.','tell a joke They sat around telling terrible jokes.','tell somebody a secret I offered to tell her my secret if she didn’t tell anyone else.','tell a lie They told lies about us.','tell the truth ‘I’m telling you the truth, ’ she persisted.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The teacher told the children to sit down quietly.","translation":"معلم به بچه ها گفت که آرام بنشینند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586744.mp3"},{"sentence":"I thought I told you not to touch anything!","translation":"فکر کردم گفتم به چیزی دست نزنی!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619630.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bernice was told she had to work late this evening.","translation":"به برنیس گفته شد که باید تا دیر وقت عصر کار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619633.mp3"},{"sentence":"Stop trying to tell me what to do all the time.","translation":"سعی نکنید همیشه به من بگویید چه کار کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586748.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do as you are told (= obey me ) and don’t ask questions.","translation":"همانطور که به شما گفته می شود انجام دهید (= از من اطاعت کنید) و سؤال نکنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619636.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('8373951e-7de7-5abf-a517-6ace349e0e64','b114160b-803f-5a5e-8272-69963d3260af',4,'know','دانستن','spoken & written','to know something or be able to recognize something because of certain signs that show this','[ intransitive, transitive not in progressive ]',null,'دانستن چیزی یا توانایی تشخیص چیزی به دلیل علائم خاصی که این را نشان می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tell a story/tale He then told the story of how he was injured while riding his motorcycle.','tell a joke They sat around telling terrible jokes.','tell somebody a secret I offered to tell her my secret if she didn’t tell anyone else.','tell a lie They told lies about us.','tell the truth ‘I’m telling you the truth, ’ she persisted.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She might have been lying. Benjy couldn’t tell.","translation":"ممکنه دروغ گفته باشه بنجی نمی توانست بگوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619642.mp3"},{"sentence":"The moment Kramer walked in, I could tell that things were not going well.","translation":"لحظه ای که کرامر وارد شد، می توانستم بگویم که اوضاع خوب پیش نمی رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586769.mp3"},{"sentence":"You could tell a mile off that he was lying.","translation":"می شد یک مایل دورتر تشخیص داد که او دروغ می گوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001827822.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s hard to tell how long the job will take.","translation":"سخت است که بگوییم این کار چقدر طول می کشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619652.mp3"},{"sentence":"I could tell from his tone of voice that Ken was disappointed.","translation":"از لحن صدایش می‌توانستم بفهمم که کن ناامید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586775.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('f2076969-a4fa-51a4-bc28-e75da6c220cd','b114160b-803f-5a5e-8272-69963d3260af',5,'recognize difference','تشخیص تفاوت','spoken & written','to be able to see how one person or thing is different from another','[ transitive not in progressive ]','tell','برای اینکه بتوانیم ببینیم یک شخص یا چیز چگونه با دیگری متفاوت است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['tell a story/tale He then told the story of how he was injured while riding his motorcycle.','tell a joke They sat around telling terrible jokes.','tell somebody a secret I offered to tell her my secret if she didn’t tell anyone else.','tell a lie They told lies about us.','tell the truth ‘I’m telling you the truth, ’ she persisted.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"How can you tell a fake Vuitton handbag from the real thing?","translation":"چگونه می توان کیف دستی ویتون تقلبی را از واقعی تشخیص داد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000586787.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you tell the difference between sparkling wine and champagne?","translation":"آیا می توانید تفاوت بین شراب گازدار و شامپاین را بگویید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619658.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
