('6e891d1e-c093-57b9-a6bc-a25fd9636768','a1850fe1-7703-57b6-a454-855cc820f1a0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to use a particular word or expression to name or describe something',null,null,'استفاده از یک کلمه یا عبارت خاص برای نامگذاری یا توصیف چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"This condition is sometimes termed RSI, or repetitive strain injury.","translation":"این وضعیت گاهی اوقات RSI یا آسیب فشاری مکرر نامیده می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000591202.mp3"},{"sentence":"These developments are loosely termed ‘advanced manufacturing techniques’.","translation":"این پیشرفت‌ها به‌طور ضعیف «تکنیک‌های تولید پیشرفته» نامیده می‌شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801235.mp3"},{"sentence":"Roosevelt termed himself and his policies ‘liberal’.","translation":"روزولت خود و سیاست هایش را «لیبرال» نامید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801234.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b3e45837-9880-5b53-aa37-00c9d3e88248','488cdda1-82be-54af-824a-bd06886ba793',1,'exam','امتحان','spoken & written','a set of questions, exercises, or practical activities to measure someone’s skill, ability, or knowledge',null,null,'آزمون، آزمون (محصول)؛ آزمون (دانشجو)؛ آزمون (سلامت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['take a test ( also do/sit a test British English ) All candidates have to take a test.','pass a test (= succeed in it ) She passed her driving test first time.','fail a test ( also flunk a test American English informal ) He failed the test and had to take it again.','do well/badly in a test British English , do well/badly on a test American English I didn’t do very well in the first part of the test.','give somebody a test The students were given a reading test.','grade a test ( also mark a test British English ) I spent the day marking tests.','a biology/history etc test On Monday we had a French test.','a spelling/reading/listening test I didn’t do very well in the listening test.','a driving test A driving test can be a nerve-racking experience.','a written test Selection was based on written tests in English and mathematics.','a multiple choice test (= in which each question has a list of answers to choose from ) There is some debate about whether multiple-choice tests are a good way of assessing student’s knowledge.','an aptitude test (= a test that measures your natural abilities )','an oral test The oral test will consist of a conversation of about 10 minutes in German.','a test paper The teacher began handing out the test papers.','a test result/score The test results are out on Friday.','a test question Some of the test questions were really difficult.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We have a test on irregular verbs tomorrow.","translation":"فردا تست افعال بی قاعده داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000592041.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you get a good mark in the test?","translation":"آیا در آزمون نمره خوبی گرفتید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626298.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('94b2cb64-3f3b-58a4-a596-3c685903f969','488cdda1-82be-54af-824a-bd06886ba793',2,'medical','پزشکی','spoken & written','a medical examination on a part of your body, or a substance taken from your body, to check your health or to discover what is wrong with you',null,null,'یک معاینه پزشکی در قسمتی از بدن یا ماده ای که از بدن شما گرفته شده است، برای بررسی سلامتی یا کشف مشکل شما','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The doctor said I needed to have a blood test .","translation":"دکتر گفت باید آزمایش خون بدهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001591.mp3"},{"sentence":"an eye test","translation":"یک آزمایش چشم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040271.mp3"},{"sentence":"a hearing test","translation":"یک تست شنوایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040272.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m still waiting for my test results from the hospital.","translation":"من هنوز منتظر جواب آزمایشم از بیمارستان هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626308.mp3"},{"sentence":"They don’t know what’s wrong with her yet – they’re doing tests.","translation":"آنها هنوز نمی دانند چه مشکلی با او وجود دارد - آنها در حال انجام آزمایش هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000592053.mp3"},{"sentence":"The tests were negative and the doctor said that she was in perfect health.","translation":"آزمایشات منفی بود و دکتر گفت که در سلامت کامل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040273.mp3"},{"sentence":"a test for HIV","translation":"یک آزمایش برای HIV","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626307.mp3"},{"sentence":"a drugs test","translation":"یک آزمایش مواد مخدر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626314.mp3"},{"sentence":"The results of the DNA test proved that Simmons was the rapist.","translation":"نتایج آزمایش DNA ثابت کرد که سیمونز متجاوز بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626315.mp3"},{"sentence":"a pregnancy test","translation":"یک تست بارداری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626321.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('33c698d4-3107-5ce3-b02d-8285bbcdd9fc','488cdda1-82be-54af-824a-bd06886ba793',3,'machine/product','ماشین / محصول','spoken & written','a process used to discover whether equipment or a product works correctly, or to discover more about it',null,null,'فرآیندی که برای کشف اینکه آیا تجهیزات یا یک محصول به درستی کار می کند یا برای کشف اطلاعات بیشتر در مورد آن استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"nuclear weapons tests","translation":"آزمایش های تسلیحات هسته ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000592066.mp3"},{"sentence":"a test for chemicals in the water","translation":"آزمایش مواد شیمیایی در آب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000592070.mp3"},{"sentence":"Laboratory tests show that the new drug is very effective.","translation":"آزمایشات آزمایشگاهی نشان می دهد که داروی جدید بسیار موثر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626326.mp3"},{"sentence":"We went to the test site in Nevada.","translation":"ما به محل آزمایش در نوادا رفتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626327.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('dd17a3a7-3780-52e6-8e9a-7abb38c75e58','488cdda1-82be-54af-824a-bd06886ba793',4,'difficult situation','وضعیت دشوار','spoken & written','a difficult situation in which the qualities of someone or something are clearly shown',null,null,'موقعیت دشواری که در آن ویژگی های کسی یا چیزی به وضوح نشان داده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Chess player Nigel Short faces Anatoly Karpov in the toughest test of his career so far.","translation":"نایجل شورت شطرنج‌باز در سخت‌ترین آزمون دوران حرفه‌ای خود به مصاف آناتولی کارپوف می‌رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626331.mp3"},{"sentence":"The problems she faced were a real test of character.","translation":"مشکلاتی که او با آن روبرو شد یک آزمون واقعی شخصیت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000592080.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
