('9cf75067-83a8-5aa8-b844-e1df0df4b9f8','c0029b28-f71f-577f-ab75-9d028f7b1eac',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used after verbs , nouns, and adjectives to introduce a clause which shows what someone says or thinks, or states a fact or reason',null,null,'اینکه، از آن‌جای (پیوند متمم)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"If she said that she’d come, she’ll come.","translation":"اگر گفت که می آید، می آید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000593343.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t believe that he’s only 17.","translation":"من نمی توانم باور کنم که او فقط 17 سال دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787191.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are you sure that they live in Park Lane?","translation":"آیا مطمئن هستید که آنها در پارک لین زندگی می کنند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787192.mp3"},{"sentence":"allegations that he is guilty of war crimes","translation":"ادعا می کند که او مرتکب جنایات جنگی شده است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787193.mp3"},{"sentence":"The fact that he is your brother-in-law should not affect your decision.","translation":"اینکه او برادر شوهر شماست نباید در تصمیم شما تاثیر بگذارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000593346.mp3"},{"sentence":"He might have left the money for the simple reason that he didn’t know it was there.","translation":"او ممکن است پول را به این دلیل ساده رها کرده باشد که نمی‌دانست آنجاست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787194.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m not surprised that you were upset","translation":"تعجب نمیکنم که ناراحت شدی","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"I’m not surprised you were upset.","translation":"تعجب نمیکنم که ناراحت شدی","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,8),
('b8f4629b-fc8b-5f11-829e-10d8d51d6879','c0029b28-f71f-577f-ab75-9d028f7b1eac',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used after a phrase with ‘so’ or ‘such’ to introduce a clause that shows the result of something',null,null,'بعد از عبارت «چنین» یا «چنین» برای معرفی بندی که نتیجه چیزی را نشان می دهد استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was so tired that I fell asleep.","translation":"آنقدر خسته بودم که خوابم برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787199.mp3"},{"sentence":"The school was so badly damaged that it had to be pulled down.","translation":"مدرسه آنقدر آسیب دید که مجبور به تخریب شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787200.mp3"},{"sentence":"We had been away for such a long time that I had forgotten her name.","translation":"خیلی وقت بود که دور بودیم که اسمش را فراموش کرده بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787201.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7c85b9c0-15b5-5bb5-8637-0a561aca1440','c0029b28-f71f-577f-ab75-9d028f7b1eac',3,null,null,'spoken & written','used to introduce a clause that refers to a fact, when describing it',null,null,'برای معرفی عبارتی استفاده می شود که به یک واقعیت اشاره دارد، در هنگام توصیف آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s odd that I haven’t heard of you.","translation":"عجیب است که من در مورد شما نشنیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787209.mp3"},{"sentence":"That anyone should want to kill her was unthinkable.","translation":"اینکه کسی بخواهد او را بکشد غیرقابل تصور بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787210.mp3"},{"sentence":"The problem is that no-one knows what will happen.","translation":"مشکل این است که هیچ کس نمی داند چه اتفاقی خواهد افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787211.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('cd8d327a-22d1-5b41-aaf9-6846a541cf92','c0029b28-f71f-577f-ab75-9d028f7b1eac',4,null,null,'formal','in order that something may happen or someone may do something',null,null,'برای اینکه ممکن است اتفاقی بیفتد یا کسی کاری انجام دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Give us strength that we may stand against them.","translation":"به ما نیرو عطا کن تا در مقابل آنها بایستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000593397.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1c87a751-3854-5b5a-8c65-7acdb6636e83','c0029b28-f71f-577f-ab75-9d028f7b1eac',5,null,null,'literary','used to express a wish for something to happen or be true , especially when this is not possible',null,null,'برای بیان آرزوی اتفاق افتادن یا واقعی بودن چیزی بکار می رود، به خصوص زمانی که این امکان وجود ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Oh, that she were alive to see this!","translation":"آه، که او زنده بود تا این را ببیند!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000593402.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3bb06657-edfd-5ab4-9f06-02ea0a28abc6','fdb4d85d-bef0-58f3-b498-74b2541c55cc',1,null,null,'spoken','used to say how big, how much etc, especially when you are showing the size , amount etc with your hands',null,null,'تا این حد، چنان (تأکید)؛ آن‌قدر (مقدار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was quite a large fish – about that long.","translation":"ماهی کاملاً بزرگی بود - تقریباً به همین طول.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000593487.mp3"},{"sentence":"He missed hitting the car in front by that much.","translation":"دلش برای ضربه زدن به ماشین جلویی تنگ شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000593488.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ef599021-c326-5eca-8ea3-74ee6ffca8fc','fdb4d85d-bef0-58f3-b498-74b2541c55cc',2,null,null,'spoken','as much as in the present situation or as much as has been stated','[ usually in negatives ]',null,'به همان اندازه که در وضعیت فعلی یا به اندازه ای که بیان شد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m sorry, I hadn’t realized the situation was that bad.","translation":"متاسفم، من متوجه نشده بودم که وضعیت آنقدر بد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787218.mp3"},{"sentence":"No one expected it to cost that much.","translation":"هیچ کس انتظار نداشت آنقدر هزینه داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787219.mp3"},{"sentence":"The advanced exam is more difficult, but not many students progress that far.","translation":"امتحان پیشرفته سخت تر است، اما دانش آموزان زیادی تا این حد پیشرفت نمی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787220.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6039c4f9-2357-5a7b-a48c-9ba2cfdf8b0d','fdb4d85d-bef0-58f3-b498-74b2541c55cc',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'not (all) that long/many etc','تا این حد، چنان (تأکید)؛ آن‌قدر (مقدار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7fd6c82a-d04f-51a0-aa1f-e1cf0abbb286','fdb4d85d-bef0-58f3-b498-74b2541c55cc',4,null,null,'spoken','used to emphasize how big, bad, much etc something is',null,null,'برای تأکید بر بزرگی، بد، زیاد بودن چیزی و غیره استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was that embarrassed I didn’t know what to say.","translation":"آنقدر خجالت کشیدم که نمی دانستم چه بگویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000593504.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1778036c-ce41-5c77-97cb-64341209e7c3','22e12082-c612-5877-8903-63f7d345a580',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to refer to two or more people or things that have already been mentioned or are already known about',null,null,'آن‌ها — ضمیر مفعولی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Has anyone seen my keys? I can’t find them anywhere.","translation":"کسی کلیدهای من را دیده است؟ هیچ جا نمیتونم پیداشون کنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594186.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police were very helpful when I spoke to them.","translation":"وقتی با آنها صحبت کردم پلیس خیلی کمک کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594187.mp3"},{"sentence":"I lent him several books, but he hasn’t read any of them.","translation":"چندین کتاب به او قرض دادم، اما او هیچ کدام را نخوانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821636.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9e234cb7-531f-5d4b-9176-0e4c9056ed3f','22e12082-c612-5877-8903-63f7d345a580',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used when talking about someone who may be male or female , to avoid saying ‘him or her’',null,null,'هنگام صحبت در مورد کسی که ممکن است مرد یا زن باشد، برای اجتناب از گفتن "او" استفاده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"If anyone phones, tell them I’ll be back later.","translation":"اگر کسی تلفن کرد، به او بگویید بعداً برمی گردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821640.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d48d2d44-0da3-5aa5-8646-4f3960c90054','a36dd1ce-acef-5578-8118-6642fdbab78f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to mean ‘those’. Many people think this use is incorrect',null,null,'به معنای "آنها" استفاده می شود. بسیاری از مردم فکر می کنند این استفاده نادرست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I couldn’t understand all them long words.","translation":"من نمی توانستم همه کلمات طولانی آنها را درک کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594209.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('29eb0f3d-f394-50f1-a56b-8eb286905ba6','0fa06bbd-b000-5a27-9c25-c9abc17d5838',1,null,null,'spoken & written','at a particular time in the past or future',null,null,'سپس، آن‌وقت؛ بعد از آن؛ آن‌زمان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I wish I had known then what I know now.","translation":"ای کاش آنچه را که اکنون می دانم، آن زمان می دانستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787286.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was then that I realised she’d tricked me.","translation":"آن موقع بود که فهمیدم او مرا فریب داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594344.mp3"},{"sentence":"He started his career in St Petersburg – or Leningrad as it then was.","translation":"او کار خود را در سن پترزبورگ یا همان لنینگراد آغاز کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594345.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’re sending out the results next week, so we won’t know anything until then.","translation":"آنها نتایج را هفته آینده ارسال می کنند، بنابراین تا آن زمان چیزی نمی دانیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787289.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was late evening when the doctor arrived, and by then it was too late.","translation":"دیر وقت بود که دکتر آمد و دیگر دیر شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787290.mp3"},{"sentence":"That was in 1970. Since then the place has changed a lot.","translation":"این در سال 1970 بود. از آن زمان تا کنون مکان بسیار تغییر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787291.mp3"},{"sentence":"They met in 1942 and from then on (= starting at that time ) they were firm friends.","translation":"آنها در سال 1942 با هم آشنا شدند و از آن به بعد (= از همان زمان شروع شد) آنها دوستان ثابتی بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787292.mp3"},{"sentence":"Silently she closed the door. Just then she heard a noise.","translation":"بی صدا در را بست. در همان لحظه او صدایی شنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787297.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was paid £1,000, which was a lot of money back then (= a long time ago when things were different ) in the 1950s.","translation":"1000 پوند به من دستمزد می دادند که در آن زمان (= خیلی وقت پیش که اوضاع فرق می کرد) در دهه 1950 پول زیادی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787301.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('bcf722a6-41c5-5680-a469-13f49c551115','0fa06bbd-b000-5a27-9c25-c9abc17d5838',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say what happens next or what you do next',null,null,'می گفت بعدش چی می شه یا بعدش چی کار می کنی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Mix the flour and butter, then add the eggs.","translation":"آرد و کره را با هم مخلوط کنید سپس تخم مرغ ها را اضافه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594364.mp3"},{"sentence":"Byron travelled to Italy and then to Greece.","translation":"بایرون به ایتالیا و سپس یونان سفر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594365.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('58fd8ff3-beed-5aa4-9dcf-eaee494723ba','0fa06bbd-b000-5a27-9c25-c9abc17d5838',3,null,null,'spoken','used when saying what the result of a situation or action will be',null,null,'هنگام گفتن اینکه نتیجه یک موقعیت یا عمل چه خواهد بود استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"If you won’t tell him, then I will.","translation":"اگر به او نگویی، من خواهم گفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787308.mp3"},{"sentence":"Start off early, then you won’t have to rush.","translation":"زود شروع کنید، آنگاه نیازی به عجله نخواهید بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787309.mp3"},{"sentence":"Still in your pyjamas? Have you just got out of bed then?","translation":"هنوز پیژامه داری؟ اونوقت تازه از رختخواب بلند شدی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594369.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
