('59e1ddda-f173-59a8-a47d-3f1f5c6ce970','2820e674-081c-576f-b70f-3f53a4fe8bd2',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to measure how fast someone or something is going, how long it takes to do something etc',null,null,'برای اندازه گیری سرعت حرکت یک نفر یا چیزی، مدت زمان انجام کاری و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We had to run up the stairs while the Sergeant timed us.","translation":"ما مجبور شدیم از پله ها بالا برویم در حالی که گروهبان زمان ما را تعیین می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573571.mp3"},{"sentence":"They timed the winner at 2 minutes and 14.05 seconds.","translation":"آنها برنده را 2 دقیقه و 14.05 ثانیه تعیین کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001818090.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('fdde9329-1ce2-5064-a631-3484fafa68df','2820e674-081c-576f-b70f-3f53a4fe8bd2',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to hit a ball or make a shot at a particular moment',null,null,'ضربه زدن به توپ یا ضربه زدن در یک لحظه خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Keith timed the pass well.","translation":"کیت پاس را به خوبی زمان بندی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573584.mp3"},{"sentence":"a beautifully timed shot","translation":"یک شات زمان بندی شده زیبا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000573581.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6a9cf9e9-7dae-538c-ae80-38c9c0b90371','39cb076c-97b8-5f8b-94a7-265e0cee12f7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a US weekly news magazine which is sold in the US and is also available in many countries around the world',null,null,'یک مجله خبری هفتگی ایالات متحده که در ایالات متحده فروخته می شود و در بسیاری از کشورهای جهان نیز موجود است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('22ea73a5-d205-50e4-90f0-f7835a603496','03832d95-9501-5e50-8ce4-ce1d378f46db',1,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely small',null,null,'بسیار کوچک، ذره‌ای','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a tiny community in the Midwest","translation":"یک جامعه کوچک در غرب میانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001984681.mp3"},{"sentence":"The earrings were tiny.","translation":"گوشواره ریز بود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001984682.mp3"},{"sentence":"a tiny little baby","translation":"یک بچه کوچولو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000574570.mp3"},{"sentence":"She always felt a tiny bit sad.","translation":"او همیشه کمی غمگین بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001827570.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bad teachers are a tiny minority .","translation":"معلمان بد یک اقلیت کوچک هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001827574.mp3"},{"sentence":"tiny pieces of paper","translation":"تکه های ریز کاغذ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001827578.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('82259758-b646-5868-823f-b17b8a703b83','19f3e8d4-8e17-5cd0-96f4-3cd5f26e8cac',1,'voice','صدا','spoken & written','the way your voice sounds, which shows how you are feeling or what you mean','[ countable ]',null,'لحن، طنین (صدا)؛ لحن (حالت)؛ لحن (زبان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['conversational (= informal and friendly ) I tried to keep my tone pleasant and conversational.','conciliatory (= showing that you do not want to be involved in an argument with someone ) She used a more conciliatory tone.','matter-of-fact (= showing no emotion when what you are saying is exciting, frightening, upsetting, etc ) His tone was matter-of-fact, but she noticed he was shaking.','measured (= very carefully controlled ) He spoke slowly, in a calm and measured tone.','clipped tones (= quick and clear, but not very friendly ) Davis’s secretary informed him in clipped tones: ‘Mr Davis is not here.’','low/quiet/hushed tones They sat at the far end of the carriage, talking in hushed tones.','somebody’s dulcet tones (= a very sweet and gentle voice – often used humorously to mean the opposite ) I could hear Martha’s dulcet tones bellowing that dinner was ready.','a tone of voice Try talking to the child in a firm but soothing tone of voice.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘You must be Annie, ’ he said in a friendly tone.","translation":"با لحنی دوستانه گفت: \"تو باید آنی باشی.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603398.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was urgency in his tone.","translation":"اضطرار در لحنش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603399.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her tone was sharp with anger.","translation":"لحنش با عصبانیت تند بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603400.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was obvious from her tone of voice that she didn’t like me.","translation":"از لحن صدایش معلوم بود که من را دوست ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603401.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4a8d3047-ef4c-5204-aa77-98f7918d6d52','19f3e8d4-8e17-5cd0-96f4-3cd5f26e8cac',2,'sound','صدا','spoken & written','the quality of a sound, especially the sound of a musical instrument or someone’s voice','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'کیفیت یک صدا، به ویژه صدای یک ساز موسیقی یا صدای کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['conversational (= informal and friendly ) I tried to keep my tone pleasant and conversational.','conciliatory (= showing that you do not want to be involved in an argument with someone ) She used a more conciliatory tone.','matter-of-fact (= showing no emotion when what you are saying is exciting, frightening, upsetting, etc ) His tone was matter-of-fact, but she noticed he was shaking.','measured (= very carefully controlled ) He spoke slowly, in a calm and measured tone.','clipped tones (= quick and clear, but not very friendly ) Davis’s secretary informed him in clipped tones: ‘Mr Davis is not here.’','low/quiet/hushed tones They sat at the far end of the carriage, talking in hushed tones.','somebody’s dulcet tones (= a very sweet and gentle voice – often used humorously to mean the opposite ) I could hear Martha’s dulcet tones bellowing that dinner was ready.','a tone of voice Try talking to the child in a firm but soothing tone of voice.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the guitar’s clean tone","translation":"صدای تمیز گیتار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603405.mp3"},{"sentence":"They talked in hushed tones.","translation":"آنها با لحن آرام صحبت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603408.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘No I didn’t, ’ he said in a low tone (= quietly ) .","translation":"او با لحنی آهسته (= آرام) گفت: «نه، نگرفتم».","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603409.mp3"},{"sentence":"an even-toned voice","translation":"صدای یکنواخت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000957076.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('dfa06d49-99b4-572e-bd75-ac507a139625','19f3e8d4-8e17-5cd0-96f4-3cd5f26e8cac',3,'general feeling/attitude','احساس/نگرش کلی','spoken & written','the general feeling or attitude expressed in a piece of writing, a speech , an activity etc','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'احساس یا نگرش کلی که در یک نوشته، یک سخنرانی، یک فعالیت و غیره بیان می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The tone of the report was radical.","translation":"لحن گزارش رادیکال بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603416.mp3"},{"sentence":"The meetings were noted for their deeply religious tone.","translation":"این جلسات به دلیل لحن عمیق مذهبی خود مورد توجه قرار گرفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603417.mp3"},{"sentence":"The article was moderate in tone.","translation":"لحن مقاله معتدل بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603420.mp3"},{"sentence":"Opening remarks are important since they set the tone for the rest of the interview.","translation":"سخنان آغازین از آنجایی که لحن را برای بقیه مصاحبه تعیین می کنند مهم هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000957086.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('57d8dd89-4877-5c6b-8db0-c42f5fb60465','19f3e8d4-8e17-5cd0-96f4-3cd5f26e8cac',4,'colour','رنگ','spoken & written','one of the many types of a particular colour, each slightly darker, lighter , brighter etc than the next','[ countable, uncountable ]','two-tone','یکی از انواع مختلف یک رنگ خاص، هر کدام کمی تیره تر، روشن تر، روشن تر و غیره از رنگ بعدی',array['shade']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"different tones of green","translation":"تناژهای مختلف سبز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000957101.mp3"},{"sentence":"Perhaps a darker tone would be better.","translation":"شاید یک لحن تیره تر بهتر باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603424.mp3"},{"sentence":"your skin tone (= the colour of your skin )","translation":"رنگ پوست شما (= رنگ پوست شما)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603425.mp3"},{"sentence":"The dried colour is slightly deeper in tone than it appears when first applied.","translation":"رنگ خشک شده کمی عمیق تر از آن چیزی است که در هنگام استفاده برای اولین بار به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603431.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
