('fdbccc66-b78a-56b0-9120-3526817f3206','95abafff-7666-57ce-82ff-0f9005fa5810',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a very tall plant that has branches and leaves, and lives for many years',null,null,'درخت، درختان (جنگل)؛ درخت (سینی)؛ درخت (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"As a kid, I loved to climb trees.","translation":"از بچگی عاشق بالا رفتن از درخت بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000557972.mp3"},{"sentence":"We planted a peach tree in the backyard.","translation":"یک درخت هلو در حیاط خانه کاشتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000557971.mp3"},{"sentence":"the trunk of an old oak tree (= the main central part, from which the branches grow )","translation":"تنه درخت بلوط کهنسال (= قسمت مرکزی اصلی که شاخه ها از آن رشد می کنند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001600760.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2d9524a5-1236-576b-9a67-845ade0e2fe9','95abafff-7666-57ce-82ff-0f9005fa5810',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a drawing that connects things with lines to show how they are related to each other',null,'family tree','نقاشی ای که اشیا را با خطوط به هم متصل می کند تا نشان دهد که آنها چگونه با یکدیگر مرتبط هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('dc6e5016-3411-5a17-8def-958720f9af72','f33fb8b3-2864-5a68-bc21-93da49d10d74',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a visit to a place that involves a journey , for pleasure or a particular purpose','[ countable ]',null,'سفر، سفر کوچک؛ سفر (کار)؛ سفر (تعطیلات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go on a trip (= go somewhere and come back ) I’ve been on a coach trip to France.','take a trip (= go somewhere for pleasure ) Take a trip on the Santa Fe railway or cruise on a Mississippi paddle boat.','make a trip (= go somewhere, and perhaps come back ) I couldn’t see him making the long trip to Minneapolis alone.','a business trip I’m on a business trip with my boss.','a shopping/fishing/skiing etc trip He was knocked off his bicycle on his way home from a shopping trip.','a school trip (= when children and teachers from a school go somewhere ) She went on a school trip to Tuscany.','a coach/bus/boat trip They took a boat trip to see the seals.','a day trip (= when you go somewhere for pleasure and come back the same day ) Take a day trip to York, which is just 15 miles away.','a round trip (= a journey to a place and back again ) His wife makes a hundred and fifty mile round trip to see him twice a week.','the return trip (= the journey back to a place ) A day or two later she began her return trip to Chicago.','a wasted trip (= a trip in which you do not achieve what you wanted to ) I’m afraid you’ve had a wasted trip. We don’t have those shoes in stock.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Did you enjoy your trip to Disneyland?","translation":"آیا از سفر خود به دیزنی لند لذت بردید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590617.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Palace is only a short trip from here.","translation":"کاخ تنها یک سفر کوتاه از اینجا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590618.mp3"},{"sentence":"a business trip to Japan","translation":"یک سفر کاری به ژاپن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000559820.mp3"},{"sentence":"Two lucky employees won a round-the-world trip.","translation":"دو کارمند خوش شانس برنده یک سفر دور دنیا شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590619.mp3"},{"sentence":"a boat trip up the Thames","translation":"سفر با قایق تا تیمز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000559817.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s an 80-mile round trip (= a journey to a place and back again ) to Exeter.","translation":"این یک سفر رفت و برگشت 80 مایلی (= سفر به یک مکان و بازگشت دوباره) به اکستر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590626.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m afraid you’ve had a wasted trip (= a trip in which you do not achieve your purpose ) , Mr Burgess has already left.","translation":"می ترسم یک سفر بیهوده داشته باشید (= سفری که در آن به هدف خود نرسیدید)، آقای برگس قبلاً رفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590633.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re thinking of taking a trip to the mountains.","translation":"ما به سفر به کوهستان فکر می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000559814.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was unable to make the trip to accept the award.","translation":"او نتوانست برای دریافت جایزه سفر کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000559811.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('3ec649b9-5cb2-5f46-bebc-37ddc60844c9','f33fb8b3-2864-5a68-bc21-93da49d10d74',2,null,null,'informal','the strange mental experiences someone has when they take a drug such as LSD','[ countable ]',null,'تجربیات ذهنی عجیبی که یک فرد هنگام مصرف دارویی مانند ال اس دی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go on a trip (= go somewhere and come back ) I’ve been on a coach trip to France.','take a trip (= go somewhere for pleasure ) Take a trip on the Santa Fe railway or cruise on a Mississippi paddle boat.','make a trip (= go somewhere, and perhaps come back ) I couldn’t see him making the long trip to Minneapolis alone.','a business trip I’m on a business trip with my boss.','a shopping/fishing/skiing etc trip He was knocked off his bicycle on his way home from a shopping trip.','a school trip (= when children and teachers from a school go somewhere ) She went on a school trip to Tuscany.','a coach/bus/boat trip They took a boat trip to see the seals.','a day trip (= when you go somewhere for pleasure and come back the same day ) Take a day trip to York, which is just 15 miles away.','a round trip (= a journey to a place and back again ) His wife makes a hundred and fifty mile round trip to see him twice a week.','the return trip (= the journey back to a place ) A day or two later she began her return trip to Chicago.','a wasted trip (= a trip in which you do not achieve what you wanted to ) I’m afraid you’ve had a wasted trip. We don’t have those shoes in stock.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a bad trip","translation":"یک سفر بد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590637.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4ecb3749-3ad2-5296-98c3-ba548d963c40','f33fb8b3-2864-5a68-bc21-93da49d10d74',3,null,null,'informal','a person or experience that is amusing and unusual','[ singular ]',null,'شخص یا تجربه ای که سرگرم کننده و غیرعادی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go on a trip (= go somewhere and come back ) I’ve been on a coach trip to France.','take a trip (= go somewhere for pleasure ) Take a trip on the Santa Fe railway or cruise on a Mississippi paddle boat.','make a trip (= go somewhere, and perhaps come back ) I couldn’t see him making the long trip to Minneapolis alone.','a business trip I’m on a business trip with my boss.','a shopping/fishing/skiing etc trip He was knocked off his bicycle on his way home from a shopping trip.','a school trip (= when children and teachers from a school go somewhere ) She went on a school trip to Tuscany.','a coach/bus/boat trip They took a boat trip to see the seals.','a day trip (= when you go somewhere for pleasure and come back the same day ) Take a day trip to York, which is just 15 miles away.','a round trip (= a journey to a place and back again ) His wife makes a hundred and fifty mile round trip to see him twice a week.','the return trip (= the journey back to a place ) A day or two later she began her return trip to Chicago.','a wasted trip (= a trip in which you do not achieve what you wanted to ) I’m afraid you’ve had a wasted trip. We don’t have those shoes in stock.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Julie’s such a trip!","translation":"جولی چنین سفری است!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590638.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('403762ae-aa35-56d9-b197-9b85121d58ad','f33fb8b3-2864-5a68-bc21-93da49d10d74',4,null,null,'spoken & written','an act of falling as a result of hitting something with your foot','[ countable ]',null,'عمل افتادن در اثر برخورد با پا به چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go on a trip (= go somewhere and come back ) I’ve been on a coach trip to France.','take a trip (= go somewhere for pleasure ) Take a trip on the Santa Fe railway or cruise on a Mississippi paddle boat.','make a trip (= go somewhere, and perhaps come back ) I couldn’t see him making the long trip to Minneapolis alone.','a business trip I’m on a business trip with my boss.','a shopping/fishing/skiing etc trip He was knocked off his bicycle on his way home from a shopping trip.','a school trip (= when children and teachers from a school go somewhere ) She went on a school trip to Tuscany.','a coach/bus/boat trip They took a boat trip to see the seals.','a day trip (= when you go somewhere for pleasure and come back the same day ) Take a day trip to York, which is just 15 miles away.','a round trip (= a journey to a place and back again ) His wife makes a hundred and fifty mile round trip to see him twice a week.','the return trip (= the journey back to a place ) A day or two later she began her return trip to Chicago.','a wasted trip (= a trip in which you do not achieve what you wanted to ) I’m afraid you’ve had a wasted trip. We don’t have those shoes in stock.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"accidents caused by trips or falls","translation":"حوادث ناشی از سفر یا سقوط","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590643.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('71ef1233-ba71-557c-8756-3080bc8b1153','d027183f-ccb5-5d19-b0e9-c8daf66cbc2a',1,'fall','سقوط','spoken & written','to hit something with your foot by accident so that you fall or almost fall','[ intransitive ]',null,'تصادفاً با پا به چیزی ضربه بزنی که زمین بخوری یا تقریباً بیفتی',array['stumble']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He tripped and fell .","translation":"زمین خورد و افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000559868.mp3"},{"sentence":"Clary tripped over a cable and broke his foot.","translation":"کلاری از روی کابل رد شد و پایش شکست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590650.mp3"},{"sentence":"He tripped on the bottom step.","translation":"روی پله پایین زمین خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590653.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9b45d7e6-fa2f-5cec-91de-1719af5718d7','d027183f-ccb5-5d19-b0e9-c8daf66cbc2a',2,'make somebody fall','کسی را وادار به زمین خوردن','spoken & written','to make someone fall by putting your foot in front of them when they are moving','[ transitive ]',null,'وقتی کسی در حال حرکت است با گذاشتن پای خود جلوی او، باعث زمین خوردن شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Baggio was tripped inside the penalty area.","translation":"باجو در محوطه جریمه زمین خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000559880.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5a562eee-3714-5b7c-a401-a35dd30004c6','d027183f-ccb5-5d19-b0e9-c8daf66cbc2a',3,'switch on','روشن کنید','spoken & written','to switch on a piece of electrical equipment by accident','[ transitive ]',null,'برای روشن کردن یک قطعه از تجهیزات الکتریکی تصادفی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"An intruder had tripped the alarm.","translation":"یک مهاجم زنگ هشدار را زده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590658.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c4c3a13a-f029-5ec9-bbfb-c1fb090bed32','d027183f-ccb5-5d19-b0e9-c8daf66cbc2a',4,'walk/dance','راه رفتن/رقصیدن','literary','to walk, run, or dance with quick light steps','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'راه رفتن، دویدن یا رقصیدن با گام های سبک سریع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a little girl tripping down the lane","translation":"دختر بچه ای که از لاین پایین می آید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000559889.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
