('edcc768b-abe1-53ce-8bdd-f4f8c75b9d0a','f0cfb648-1a4a-5103-ac61-0022348682dd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone or something that uses a product , service etc',null,null,'مصرف‌کننده، کاربر؛ استفاده‌کننده (سرویس)؛ کاربر (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['computer users Computer users are being warned to look out for the virus.','road users Did you signal to let other road users know you were turning right?','business users The hotel caters mainly to business users.','Internet users Internet users who illegally download music and films could face large fines.','a heavy user (= someone who uses something a lot ) Electricity companies are warning that heavy users face much higher bills.','a regular user Regular sunbed users are likely to suffer long-term skin damage.','a light user (= someone who uses something only a little ) Light users of the service will receive a reduction in their bill.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"road users","translation":"کاربران جاده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620299.mp3"},{"sentence":"a computer user","translation":"یک کاربر کامپیوتر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620300.mp3"},{"sentence":"library users","translation":"کاربران کتابخانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620301.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0e8fed69-baee-5fae-a944-fb9ac223b839','f0cfb648-1a4a-5103-ac61-0022348682dd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who takes illegal drugs',null,null,'کسی که داروهای غیرقانونی مصرف می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['computer users Computer users are being warned to look out for the virus.','road users Did you signal to let other road users know you were turning right?','business users The hotel caters mainly to business users.','Internet users Internet users who illegally download music and films could face large fines.','a heavy user (= someone who uses something a lot ) Electricity companies are warning that heavy users face much higher bills.','a regular user Regular sunbed users are likely to suffer long-term skin damage.','a light user (= someone who uses something only a little ) Light users of the service will receive a reduction in their bill.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Drug users were warned about the dangers of sharing needles.","translation":"به مصرف کنندگان مواد مخدر در مورد خطرات استفاده از سوزن های مشترک هشدار داده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001687.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ab3dca58-21a3-584b-a737-710e8455533c','1c466091-cf80-5aa4-829e-8ac6d9925add',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if several things of the same type vary, they are all different from each other','[ intransitive ]',null,'متفاوت بودن؛ تغییر کردن (قیمت)؛ متفاوت بودن (فرد)',array['differ']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['considerably/greatly/widely The amount of food available varies considerably from season to season.','enormously Farm sizes vary enormously within Europe.','significantly The software seems similar, but performance can vary significantly.','slightly The cooking time may vary slightly depending on your oven.','wildly (= a lot ) Prices varied wildly from store to store.','varying degrees She was involved in a number of car accidents of varying degrees of seriousness.','varying levels Children with varying levels of ability can still be taught together.','varying sizes a set of jars of varying sizes','varying amounts Tap water may contain varying amounts of rust, grit and silt.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Test scores vary from school to school .","translation":"نمرات آزمون از مدرسه ای به مدرسه دیگر متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664675.mp3"},{"sentence":"The heights of the plants vary from 8 cm to 20 cm.","translation":"ارتفاع بوته ها از 8 سانتی متر تا 20 سانتی متر متغیر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943218.mp3"},{"sentence":"flowers that vary in color and size","translation":"گلهایی که رنگ و اندازه آنها متفاوت است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001542300.mp3"},{"sentence":"Medical treatment varies greatly from state to state.","translation":"درمان پزشکی از ایالت به ایالت دیگر بسیار متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664682.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cooking times may vary slightly , depending on your oven.","translation":"زمان پخت بسته به فر شما ممکن است کمی متفاوت باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943227.mp3"},{"sentence":"Charges vary according to size.","translation":"هزینه ها با توجه به اندازه متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943231.mp3"},{"sentence":"She has tried different diets with varying degrees of success.","translation":"او رژیم های غذایی مختلفی را با درجات مختلف موفقیت امتحان کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664678.mp3"},{"sentence":"tests of varying levels of difficulty","translation":"آزمون هایی با سطوح مختلف دشواری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943235.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('e57c2027-9f9b-5891-880c-9ffc95d7dd1d','1c466091-cf80-5aa4-829e-8ac6d9925add',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if something varies, it changes depending on the situation','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر چیزی متفاوت باشد، بسته به موقعیت تغییر می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['considerably/greatly/widely The amount of food available varies considerably from season to season.','enormously Farm sizes vary enormously within Europe.','significantly The software seems similar, but performance can vary significantly.','slightly The cooking time may vary slightly depending on your oven.','wildly (= a lot ) Prices varied wildly from store to store.','varying degrees She was involved in a number of car accidents of varying degrees of seriousness.','varying levels Children with varying levels of ability can still be taught together.','varying sizes a set of jars of varying sizes','varying amounts Tap water may contain varying amounts of rust, grit and silt.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Quentin’s mood seems to vary according to the weather.","translation":"به نظر می رسد خلق و خوی کوئنتین با توجه به آب و هوا متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001542308.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘What do you wear when you go out?’ ‘Well, it varies .’","translation":"«وقتی بیرون می‌روی چه می‌پوشی؟» «خب، فرق می‌کند.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001542311.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6f188c73-938d-5824-9b66-aee1411b8560','1c466091-cf80-5aa4-829e-8ac6d9925add',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to change something to make it different','[ transitive ]',null,'تغییر دادن چیزی برای متفاوت کردن آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['considerably/greatly/widely The amount of food available varies considerably from season to season.','enormously Farm sizes vary enormously within Europe.','significantly The software seems similar, but performance can vary significantly.','slightly The cooking time may vary slightly depending on your oven.','wildly (= a lot ) Prices varied wildly from store to store.','varying degrees She was involved in a number of car accidents of varying degrees of seriousness.','varying levels Children with varying levels of ability can still be taught together.','varying sizes a set of jars of varying sizes','varying amounts Tap water may contain varying amounts of rust, grit and silt.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"My doctor said I should vary my diet more.","translation":"دکترم گفت باید رژیمم رو بیشتر تغییر بدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001542316.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b530ae55-f319-594c-b082-02fec5eb6d90','fe0cd994-ed39-590c-af49-288fd2f27340',1,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely large',null,null,'وسیع، پهناور؛ عظیم (امپراتوری)؛ انبوه (مقدار)',array['huge']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The government will have to borrow vast amounts of money.","translation":"دولت باید مبالغ هنگفتی وام بگیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001966083.mp3"},{"sentence":"The refugees come across the border in vast numbers .","translation":"پناهجویان به تعداد زیادی از مرز می آیند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001966084.mp3"},{"sentence":"vast areas of rainforest","translation":"مناطق وسیعی از جنگل های بارانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001542369.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the past five years, there has been a vast improvement in graduation rates.","translation":"در پنج سال گذشته، بهبود زیادی در نرخ فارغ التحصیلی وجود داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664696.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('f65630b1-7cbf-5bb3-8a37-548a9d662fe8','fe0cd994-ed39-590c-af49-288fd2f27340',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the vast majority (of something)','وسیع، پهناور؛ عظیم (امپراتوری)؛ انبوه (مقدار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('58f494e9-2a72-585d-a153-bab25bb8bf7b','7454f0f3-b140-5dfd-ba26-5d465a494603',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize an adjective , adverb , or phrase','[ +adj/adverb ]',null,'بسیار، خیلی (تأکید)؛ به‌شدت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It feels very cold today.","translation":"امروز هوا خیلی سرده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543888.mp3"},{"sentence":"The fishing industry is very important to the area.","translation":"صنعت ماهیگیری برای این منطقه بسیار مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593024.mp3"},{"sentence":"The traffic’s moving very slowly this morning.","translation":"امروز صبح ترافیک بسیار کند در حال حرکت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543891.mp3"},{"sentence":"problems that are very similar to mine","translation":"مشکلاتی که خیلی شبیه من هستند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593025.mp3"},{"sentence":"I feel a lot better – thank you very much .","translation":"احساس خیلی بهتری دارم - خیلی ممنون.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543889.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m very, very (= used for emphasis ) pleased you can come.","translation":"من بسیار، بسیار (= برای تاکید استفاده می شود) خوشحالم که می توانید بیایید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543887.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s very kind of you to help.","translation":"خیلی لطف دارید که کمک کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593033.mp3"},{"sentence":"My sister and I were married on the very same (= exactly the same ) day.","translation":"من و خواهرم در یک روز (= دقیقاً یکسان) ازدواج کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543896.mp3"},{"sentence":"We only use the very best ingredients.","translation":"ما فقط از بهترین مواد اولیه استفاده می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593040.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('8360065a-35b3-51ff-8943-0aada459263d','7454f0f3-b140-5dfd-ba26-5d465a494603',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'not very good/happy/far etc','بسیار، خیلی (تأکید)؛ به‌شدت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d8c437a2-dcd8-5528-a2c6-1579db0530f4','7454f0f3-b140-5dfd-ba26-5d465a494603',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'your very own','بسیار، خیلی (تأکید)؛ به‌شدت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('558ddc88-18ac-5c3b-ba02-85e448435612','7454f0f3-b140-5dfd-ba26-5d465a494603',4,null,null,'informal','used with adjectives to say that the quality something has is very noticeable or typical',null,null,'با صفت ها برای گفتن اینکه کیفیت چیزی بسیار قابل توجه یا معمولی است استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was a very male reaction, I thought.","translation":"فکر کردم این یک واکنش بسیار مردانه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593060.mp3"},{"sentence":"His films are always very French.","translation":"فیلم های او همیشه بسیار فرانسوی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593061.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
