('c8a4a06c-fb2d-5004-a223-0c1c39788019','abae1d98-e273-5e70-bfe0-d78e85f2063b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize that you are talking exactly about one particular thing or person',null,null,'همان، عین (تأکید)؛ دقیق (باز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the very end To the very end of his life he remained a controversial figure.','the very beginning It is clear from the very beginning of the play that he is a weak and unpopular ruler.','the very heart of something The hotel is located in the very heart of the city.','the very fact that The very fact that this is their second home means that they are well-off.','the/that/this very moment At that very moment, the doorbell rang.','the/that very thing How can he say that it''s wrong, and then go and do that very thing himself?','the very nature/essence of something As a travel writer, the very nature of his job meant that he travelled a lot.','the very existence of something If the new project fails, it could threaten the very existence of the company.','the very idea/thought (= just an idea or suggestion ) The very idea of acting on stage scares the pants off me.','this/that very reason I want everyone to be able to cook my recipes, so for that very reason I chose inexperienced cooks to test them.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He died in this very room.","translation":"او در همین اتاق درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543934.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll start at the very beginning.","translation":"من از همان ابتدا شروع می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593076.mp3"},{"sentence":"Those were his very words.","translation":"این همان حرف های او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593080.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’d better start doing some work this very minute (= now, not later ) .","translation":"بهتر است از همین دقیقه (= اکنون، نه بعد) شروع به انجام برخی کارها کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543938.mp3"},{"sentence":"That might provoke a riot, the very thing he was trying to avoid.","translation":"این ممکن است باعث شورش شود، همان چیزی که او سعی داشت از آن اجتناب کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543950.mp3"},{"sentence":"The very fact that you are reading this book suggests you want to improve your fitness.","translation":"همین واقعیت که شما در حال خواندن این کتاب هستید نشان می دهد که می خواهید تناسب اندام خود را بهبود ببخشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593087.mp3"},{"sentence":"By its very nature , capitalism involves exploitation of the worker.","translation":"سرمایه داری در ذات خود مستلزم استثمار کارگر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593090.mp3"},{"sentence":"His life’s work was being destroyed before his very eyes (= directly in front of him ) .","translation":"کار زندگی او در مقابل چشمانش (= مستقیماً در مقابل او) نابود می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001593093.mp3"},{"sentence":"The very thought of food made me feel ill.","translation":"فکر کردن به غذا باعث شد احساس بیماری کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001543942.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('754d06c0-0188-58af-bbd1-9a54618da86b','f1ee75e6-6490-5862-a9b9-2702c4238dab',1,'opinion','نظر','spoken & written','what you think or believe about something','[ countable ]','point of view ( 2 )','نظر، دیدگاه؛ نظر (فرد)؛ منظر (منظر)',array['opinion']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have/hold a view (= have an opinion ) He has very left-wing views.','take the view that ... (= have a particular view ) The Government took the view that the law did not need to be changed.','express a view (= say what you think about something ) This is a chance for you to express your views.','give your view (= say what you think ) He did not hesitate to give his own views on the subject.','share a view (= agree with it ) This view is not shared by his colleagues.','support a view (= believe or help to prove that it is right ) There are many people who would support his views.','hear a view ( also listen to a view ) a chance to hear people’s views on a range of different subjects','tell somebody your view ( also let somebody have your view ) We want you to tell us your views.','somebody’s view changes Your view about these things changes as you get older.','political views His political views have not changed.','somebody’s personal view My own personal view is that they’re being optimistic.','widely-held view There is a widely-held view that young people eat too much junk food.','the general view (= what most people think ) The general view was that he had done well.','strong views She has strong views on education.','strongly held/deeply held views (= strong views that someone is unwilling to change ) He is known for his strongly held views on modern art.','different views Different people have different views about this subject.','conflicting/opposing views (= completely different ) There are conflicting views about the best way to teach reading.','extreme a politician who has extreme views on immigration','moderate His views have recently become more moderate.','outrageous The chairman said that Mr McNeil’s views were outrageous.','traditional traditional views about women','old-fashioned Some of his views now sound very old-fashioned.','popular/unpopular This view has become increasingly popular in society. It’s now a rather unpopular view.','right-wing/left-wing the students’ extreme left-wing views','be of the same view (= agree ) They were all of the same view.','be of differing/different views (= disagree ) They get on well, though they are of differing views on politics.','an exchange of views (= when people say what they think, especially when they disagree ) There was a frank exchange of views at the meeting.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What’s your view on the subject?","translation":"نظر شما در مورد موضوع چیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943625.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their view is that competition is good for business.","translation":"نظر آنها این است که رقابت برای تجارت خوب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001700.mp3"},{"sentence":"In my view , the country needs a change of government.","translation":"به نظر من کشور نیاز به تغییر حکومت دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943656.mp3"},{"sentence":"What do you think about her new boyfriend?","translation":"نظرت در مورد دوست پسر جدیدش چیه؟","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('434718bd-d747-5648-99e8-307669125a77','f1ee75e6-6490-5862-a9b9-2702c4238dab',2,'way of considering','روش در نظر گرفتن','spoken & written','a way of thinking about or understanding something','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'روشی برای تفکر یا درک چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Mum’s view of the situation was different to mine.","translation":"نگاه مامان به موقعیت با من متفاوت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589687.mp3"},{"sentence":"a realistic view of human nature","translation":"نگاه واقع بینانه به طبیعت انسان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589690.mp3"},{"sentence":"traditional views of religion","translation":"دیدگاه های سنتی دین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589691.mp3"},{"sentence":"You need to have a clear view (= a definite idea ) of the kind of book you want to write.","translation":"شما باید دیدگاه روشنی (= ایده قطعی) از نوع کتابی که می خواهید بنویسید داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589692.mp3"},{"sentence":"She took a pretty dim view of his behaviour.","translation":"نگاه بسیار مبهمی به رفتار او داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549778.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('d7392d96-acf5-5c4e-93b0-71523e1f63bf','f1ee75e6-6490-5862-a9b9-2702c4238dab',3,'sight','بینایی','spoken & written','what you are able to see or whether you can see it','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'آنچه را می توانید ببینید یا اینکه آیا می توانید آن را ببینید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’d like a room with a view of the sea.","translation":"ما اتاقی با منظره دریا می خواهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589704.mp3"},{"sentence":"The house has wonderful views over the valley.","translation":"این خانه دارای منظره فوق العاده ای از دره است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549788.mp3"},{"sentence":"Suddenly the pyramids came into view.","translation":"ناگهان اهرام نمایان شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589712.mp3"},{"sentence":"The gun was hidden from view behind the door.","translation":"اسلحه از دید پشت در پنهان بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589715.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fran hit him in full view of all the guests (= where they could see it clearly ) .","translation":"فران در مقابل دیدگان همه مهمانان (= جایی که آنها به وضوح می دیدند) او را زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589716.mp3"},{"sentence":"During an eclipse, the Moon blocks our view of the Sun (= stops us from seeing it ) .","translation":"در طول ماه گرفتگی، ماه دید ما از خورشید را مسدود می کند (= ما را از دیدن آن باز می دارد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589722.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('19e20879-3817-5059-9d3a-36077d075352','f1ee75e6-6490-5862-a9b9-2702c4238dab',4,'scenery','مناظر','spoken & written','the whole area that you can see from somewhere, especially when it is very beautiful or impressive','[ countable ]',null,'کل منطقه ای که می توانید از جایی ببینید، به خصوص زمانی که بسیار زیبا یا چشمگیر است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"From the top you get a panoramic view of the city.","translation":"از بالا منظره ای پانوراما از شهر خواهید داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549815.mp3"},{"sentence":"A huge nuclear reactor now spoils the view .","translation":"یک رآکتور هسته ای عظیم اکنون دید را خراب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001701.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a089f669-6256-5f67-9a47-45aa5944296b','f1ee75e6-6490-5862-a9b9-2702c4238dab',5,'picture','تصویر','spoken & written','a photograph or picture showing a beautiful or interesting place','[ countable ]',null,'عکس یا تصویری که یک مکان زیبا یا جالب را نشان می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The book contains over fifty scenic views of Cambridge.","translation":"این کتاب شامل بیش از پنجاه منظره منظره از کمبریج است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549827.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1ac47e28-f109-5d8f-9df4-9a95b2fa4806','f1ee75e6-6490-5862-a9b9-2702c4238dab',6,'chance to see something','فرصتی برای دیدن چیزی','spoken & written','an occasion or time when it is possible for people to see something such as an art show','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'موقعیت یا زمانی که امکان دیدن چیزی مانند یک نمایش هنری برای مردم وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A private view of the Summer Exhibition will be held.","translation":"نمایی خصوصی از نمایشگاه تابستانی برگزار می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589751.mp3"},{"sentence":"The painting is currently on view at the Tate.","translation":"این نقاشی در حال حاضر در تیت در معرض دید قرار دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943675.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
