('5c7466e6-f3a4-5547-8609-c1fd48d7ccaa','5ff83f40-0b71-564b-8ea3-3d531719450b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to think about something or someone in a particular way',null,null,'در مورد چیزی یا کسی به روشی خاص فکر کردن',array['see']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The law should be viewed as a way of meeting certain social goals.","translation":"قانون باید به عنوان راهی برای دستیابی به اهداف اجتماعی معین در نظر گرفته شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589774.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s an issue that can be viewed from several perspectives.","translation":"موضوعی است که از چند منظر قابل بررسی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589777.mp3"},{"sentence":"The local people viewed newcomers with suspicion.","translation":"مردم محلی به تازه واردان با شک نگاه می کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549883.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ec1c51ab-c187-5364-b742-ccd4ea80ca0f','5ff83f40-0b71-564b-8ea3-3d531719450b',2,null,null,'formal','to look at something, especially because it is beautiful or you are interested in it',null,null,'نگاه کردن به چیزی، به خصوص به این دلیل که زیبا است یا به آن علاقه دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The mountain is best viewed from the north side.","translation":"کوه از سمت شمال بهتر دیده می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589781.mp3"},{"sentence":"Thousands of tourists come to view the gardens every year.","translation":"سالانه هزاران گردشگر برای تماشای این باغ ها می آیند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549872.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1e77e0dc-7454-5bef-a3ce-0a974b287005','5ff83f40-0b71-564b-8ea3-3d531719450b',3,null,null,'formal','to watch a television programme , film etc',null,null,'برای تماشای یک برنامه تلویزیونی، فیلم و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an opportunity to view the film before it goes on general release","translation":"فرصتی برای تماشای فیلم قبل از اکران عمومی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549890.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('493cf37e-48c8-519e-b38b-0e782d3b1cae','1a833672-40dd-5d6a-b8eb-60e3b1361370',1,'in election/to support','در انتخابات/حمایت کردن','spoken & written','to show which person or party you want, or whether you support a plan, by marking a piece of paper , raising your hand etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]','block voting','رأی دادن؛ رأی‌گیری کردن (تصمیم)؛ انتخاب کردن (با رأی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['vote yes/no How many people voted Yes in the referendum?','vote Conservative/Democrat etc (= vote for someone who is Conservative etc ) Cubans in the city of Miami have traditionally voted Republican.','unanimously (= with everyone voting a particular way ) The committee voted unanimously in favour of the proposition.','overwhelmingly (= by a very large majority ) On Dec. 7 delegates voted overwhelmingly to strike.','narrowly (= by a small majority ) The Senate voted narrowly to continue funding the controversial project.','tactically (= not for the party you support, but to get an acceptable result ) People appear to have voted tactically in order to prevent the Conservative candidate from gaining a seat.','be eligible/entitled to vote All those aged 18 or over are eligible to vote.','register to vote (= put your name on a list of voters ) We must encourage people to register to vote.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"In 1918 British women got the right to vote.","translation":"در سال 1918 زنان بریتانیایی حق رای یافتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001553406.mp3"},{"sentence":"I voted for the Labour candidate in the last election.","translation":"من در انتخابات گذشته به نامزد حزب کارگر رای دادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001553409.mp3"},{"sentence":"53% of Danes voted in favour of the Maastricht treaty.","translation":"53 درصد دانمارکی ها به معاهده ماستریخت رای مثبت دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001553418.mp3"},{"sentence":"The people of Ulster had finally been given a chance to vote on the issue.","translation":"سرانجام به مردم اولستر فرصت داده شد تا در مورد این موضوع رای دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001618672.mp3"},{"sentence":"Congress voted to increase foreign aid by 10%.","translation":"کنگره به افزایش 10 درصدی کمک های خارجی رای داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001553415.mp3"},{"sentence":"Shareholders voted to reject the offer.","translation":"سهامداران به رد این پیشنهاد رای دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001618675.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve voted Democrat all my life.","translation":"من تمام عمرم به دموکرات رای داده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001553427.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('1ad67cd4-04a0-51c3-abdb-0bc3ff351318','1a833672-40dd-5d6a-b8eb-60e3b1361370',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'vote somebody into/out of power/office/parliament etc','رأی دادن؛ رأی‌گیری کردن (تصمیم)؛ انتخاب کردن (با رأی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['vote yes/no How many people voted Yes in the referendum?','vote Conservative/Democrat etc (= vote for someone who is Conservative etc ) Cubans in the city of Miami have traditionally voted Republican.','unanimously (= with everyone voting a particular way ) The committee voted unanimously in favour of the proposition.','overwhelmingly (= by a very large majority ) On Dec. 7 delegates voted overwhelmingly to strike.','narrowly (= by a small majority ) The Senate voted narrowly to continue funding the controversial project.','tactically (= not for the party you support, but to get an acceptable result ) People appear to have voted tactically in order to prevent the Conservative candidate from gaining a seat.','be eligible/entitled to vote All those aged 18 or over are eligible to vote.','register to vote (= put your name on a list of voters ) We must encourage people to register to vote.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
