trees were all swaying in the wind.','wind speed Wind speeds of up to 80 miles an hour were recorded.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t drink beer – it gives me wind.","translation":"من نمی توانم آبجو بنوشم - به من باد می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000490591.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘What’s wrong with the baby?’ ‘Just a little wind.’","translation":"\"مشکل بچه چیست؟\" \"فقط باد کمی.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001740716.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
